  "title": "Interface Creates Immersive, Biophilic-Inspired Experience at Chicago Design Week",
  "summary": "Interface, Inc., the global flooring and sustainability leader, today introduces Forest Within™ and Cut & Form™, two new flooring collections that translate biophilic design into immersive, sensory-rich commercial interior environments. Debuting at Chicago Design Week, the collections transform the Interface showroom, creating visual and experiential connections to nature through design and materials. The company will also showcase its new noravant™ rubber flooring that uniquely combines design flexibility, high performance, and enhanced sustainability in an innovative PVC-free solution.",
